            "review_title": "Review at Nha Trang Wangtukkeong",
            "review_text": "nha trang forever\nNha Trang, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nDelicious pork belly and amazing Korean food experience!\nAug 2026 • Family\nHad a fantastic meal here!! \nWang Dduk-keong BBQ completely hit the spot. The samgyeopsal (pork belly) was thick, fresh, and cooked to perfection on the traditional dome grill. The banchan (side dishes) tasted just like home-cooked Korean food, and the overall value for the portion size was great. A wonderful place to visit with family or friends when you want a break from local cuisine.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 27, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
